[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3893939472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111075#issuecomment-3893939472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111075","id":3893939472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oGM0Q","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T23:23:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T23:23:10Z","body":"For reference, my current plan is to assign a refcount of 1 to `RefCounted` on instantiation (during constructor), then give ownership over this refcount to the caller of the constructor by handing out a `Ref` without increasing the refcount further.\n\nThis fix is highly complex and will likely take a while, perhaps even a few minor versions.\n\nThe first step to doing this is to make sure all callers of `RefCounted` constructors receive a `RefCounted`. My PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965 makes a step in this direction.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/389